  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 13th level, the courser may use their determined stalker ability against creatures they threaten even if a creature’s movement would not normally provoke an attack of opportunity, as long as the creature has fewer Hit Dice than the courser’s character level and the courser is aware of the creature’s presence. This includes if the creature takes a 5-foot step, or has an ability that would allow them to move from their square without usually provoking an attack of opportunity.</p>\n<p>At 19th level, the courser can use this ability regardless of the creature’s Hit Dice.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/courser#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
